    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Rolling conversation summary. Every time the history since the last fold crosses a trigger, this node compresses the older interactions (everything outside <computeroutput>keep_recent_turns</computeroutput>) into a SummaryComponent. Generate-class projection then renders that summary at the end of its system message and replays history only from <computeroutput>covered_through + 1</computeroutput>, so a long dialogue stays coherent at a fixed token cost instead of being trimmed away. Place it last in the graph, after the node that produced the player-facing reply. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
